changing game play, how about these other changes:  Free
identification of items.  What's this scroll do? Save, read it,
reload, name it.  How bout this amulet, save, put it on, oh shit it's
choking, reload, name it.  You will now always complete Sokoban
without losing any luck.  Numerous other problems can be avoided
instead of dealt with, like getting poisoned down to low strength and
not be able to even carry your armor until you find a solution,
accidentally teleporting out of a shop at low levels and being chased
by the Kops.  Being able to save and reload removes almost every
challenge in the game.

